  <h2>Overview</h2>
  <p>Deluxe Stove is a higher-tier stove used for cooking. Upgraded stoves are designed to reduce cooking time, making them useful when the kitchen becomes a service bottleneck.</p>
  <h2>How to Get</h2>
  <p>The Deluxe Stove is included among the <code>2MVISITS</code> code rewards. Visit the <a href="/codes/">Codes page</a> for the current code list and redemption steps.</p>
  <h2>How to Use</h2>
  <p>Place the stove in the cooking area and use it as part of the normal order workflow. Consider adding or upgrading cooking stations when waiting orders begin to outpace the kitchen.</p>
